         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">NCP1070 - High-Voltage Switcher for Low Power Offline SMPS</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The NCP107x products integrate a fixed frequency current mode controller with a 700 V MOSFET. Available in a PDIPâˆ’7 or SOT-223 package, the NCP107x offer a high level of integration, including softâˆ’start, frequencyâˆ’jittering, shortâˆ’circuit protection, skipâˆ’cycle, a&#xA;maximum peak current set point, ramp compensation, and a Dynamic Selfâˆ’Supply (eliminating the need for an auxiliary winding).</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
